 of the Patience, standing in the ice: Council nave, archive, docks.","x":373,"y":300,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1793092647442,"updatedAt":1793092647442},{"id":"t0Wl0SE7oewjuf1pWnC-B","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","mapLayerId":"-3FUCPr-YvwqnxSWDncm8","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Admonition","description":"Combine escort cutter: marines and torpedoes.","x":320,"y":500,"imageId":null,"iconType":"custom","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1793092647442,"updatedAt":1793092647442},{"id":"u6SIYzy2E9ke-eSiBWhd1","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","mapLayerId":"GuSCi2SF9D-U0AOs7WScb","linkedMapLayerId":"-3FUCPr-YvwqnxSWDncm8","name":"Corva","description":"A red dwarf at the end of a minor lane, with one giant worth the trip.","x":480,"y":500,"imageId":null,"iconType":"region","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1793092647442,"updatedAt":1793092647442},{"id":"vKHyRAccL5wEZtMsUVoiV","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","mapLayerId":"msFzMRv70OhXq4ot4EXbt","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"South Lock","description":"The city's southern surface lock.","x":800,"y":700,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1793092647442,"updatedAt":1793092647442},{"id":"wXXMQp6GRLHKHigIi-C2U","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","mapLayerId":"msFzMRv70OhXq4ot4EXbt","linkedMapLayerId":null,"name":"The Cells","description":"Prison levels under the Spine.","x":373,"y":700,"imageId":null,"iconType":"building","tags":[],"factionId":null,"createdAt":1793092647442,"updatedAt":1793092647442}],"characters":[{"id":"1LES0QB1fovVBe_mxEF9-","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Lusine Arda","aliases":["Lusine"],"description":"Tether-runner and comms tech on the Patience, 24. Found out the Combine's closure plan; dies on the line in the first dip of the book.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"30F7q1i2sIwHw4pCvLZ0l","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Lucan Strand","aliases":["the First Shareholder"],"description":"First Shareholder of Patience, head of the oldest shared family. Silver-voiced, sincere about his city and about who it belongs to.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"3R7R2sIeO9NEfLc-kXNBD","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Ama Venn","aliases":["Ama"],"description":"Isaura's mother, sixties, with the ice cough of the Ninth Tier. A quiet Lamper who mends filters for a living.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"63DoU2dDLxWj32EVVqicW","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Juno Brask","aliases":["Juno"],"description":"Til's niece, 17, bonded clerk in Mother Szabo's counting-house on her dead mother's debt. Sharp, furious, braver than she knows.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"7uAqOYc-4fgdZRkVVqvyq","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Ozias Mbeki","aliases":["Oz"],"description":"Engineer of the Dray, sixties, Til's oldest friend. A Roundsman who believes what goes out comes back; gentle hands, filthy jokes.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"8cB3jrjfoG67DI_gcDFup","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Mattias Ebb","aliases":["Ebb","the lieutenant"],"description":"Concord lieutenant shot down over Kettle and taken prisoner. A conscript bonded for his family's debt; dry, frightened, decent.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"9oc4cwEG3Gzt1Rf9mGOU8","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Anselm Grieve","aliases":["Grieve","the Commodore"],"description":"Commodore of the Concord of Vey fleet besieging Kettle. Patient, legalistic, under orders he would rather not show anyone.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"BWv9X2DJVsUM9_cYB8nmH","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Dasha Imre","aliases":["Dasha"],"description":"Rigger and Lamper from the lower warrens, 40s, tattooed with comet-tails. Crews the Lamp Run.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"BgYGx1cLPM9apNDFMnawQ","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Hollis Vey","aliases":["Hollis","Mr Vey"],"description":"The last of the Vey line, dying, carried in a medical cradle. Hires the Dray to reach the Lamp before it breaks; knows more than he says.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"Gcjl3v1bFg5LHEGAAgxK4","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Aurelian Quist","aliases":["Quist","the factor"],"description":"Halloran-Vey factor sent to close the Corva operation. Polished, tired, honest when cornered; has done this before and carries the Sanitation Agent as insurance.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"LI6JgzRLnmepOH42AuZlN","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Til Brask","aliases":["Til","Tilde Brask","Captain Brask"],"description":"Captain of the salvage tug Dray, 44, ex-convict, in debt to everyone. Sardonic, practical, a woman who always takes the deal; carries the death of her sister.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return","protagonist","POV"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"NzpTETix1qHfkVk8GdUiW","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Odile Arda","aliases":["Odile"],"description":"Lusine's younger sister, 19, a tether-runner. Fierce, fast, unforgiving; wants the person who cut her sister's line.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"P0QOGj-k7ijtAa43xafP3","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Corwin Hale","aliases":["Hale","the chief warden"],"description":"Chief warden of the Patience, a bonded trusty who keeps discipline for the Company. Big, patient, practical; the Company's informer-in-chief, and the man who will deal with whoever holds power.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"SLv4Xt1XcyIiAez88Ba50","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Corin Strand","aliases":["Corin"],"description":"Lucan's son, 28, the best dipper-pilot in the city. Brave, proud, raised on the Purchase; flies the Lamp Run.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"W7RM_wucwxJNFn7_wDQ5U","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Grandam Teska","aliases":["Teska","Grandam"],"description":"Oldest living dipper on the Patience, past eighty, blind in one eye. Keeper of the dippers' sayings: the Lamp takes the dead out and brings them back.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"XfU-bCjePHgt2UqnJ_Dmb","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Severin Lachance","aliases":["Lachance","Captain Lachance"],"description":"Captain of the Combine escort cutter Admonition. Courteous, unhurried, without mercy or malice.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"aE1q6lwq3aKIEZsxYRiSi","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Danek Sorell","aliases":["Danek"],"description":"Rigger on Maren's line crew, big-handed, a singer. Goes into the Clement's collar first on the night of the mutiny.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"f5vdu9iWDF4RunSOdvhju","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Maren Tsolo","aliases":["Maren","the tether-chief","the Tether-Woman"],"description":"Tether-chief of the skimmer Patience, 41, bonded to the Halloran-Vey Combine from birth. Hard, wry and exact; runs the line that hauls the Bucket through Gall's cloud-tops. Leads the mutiny of 2391.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded","protagonist","POV"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"birthDate":null,"version":1,"createdAt":1793092250466,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"fJjoCNwIiKNSC90-YAJ0M","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Pilar Ocampo","aliases":["Pilar"],"description":"Nine-year-old girl of the Ninth Tier whose family's air Isaura cuts.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"gSFQNEhru5BVTCJEkx5If","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Cato Marchetti","aliases":["Cato","Marchetti"],"description":"Hollis Vey's agent and bodyguard. Courteous, scarred, very still.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"iKuErqTrS1waoTJ_wqWo4","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Malachy Orr","aliases":["Brother Malachy","Malachy","the Archivist"],"description":"Archivist of the Spine, seventies, once Isaura's schoolmaster. Dry, frail, dangerous with a fact.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"jBsMQnxLBcZH1iyd6QULx","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Isaura Venn","aliases":["Isaura"],"description":"Air-warden of the city of Patience, 31, unshared by birth. Reads meters and cuts the air of tithe-defaulters; good at a cruel job, and tells herself it keeps people alive. Narrates the siege.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Siege","protagonist","POV"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"jmbAXO38b1gm_pdxz69KG","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Abel Tsolo","aliases":["Abel"],"description":"Maren's younger brother, 29, a rigger on the Patience. Charming, quick, a gambler buried in debt; informs for the Company through Corwin Hale and carries the death of Lusine Arda.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"kIPNvz8mAaCNYGbid2mX2","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Ilona Szabo","aliases":["Mother Szabo","Szabo"],"description":"Debt-broker of Cinderhaven, who holds Til's paper and Juno's bond. Captain-owner of the Carrion Hymn.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return","antagonist"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"mLpvcQPj-Bo65mvtW4T5L","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Marta Oyelowo","aliases":["Oyelowo","the sergeant"],"description":"Sergeant of the six Combine marines aboard the Clement. A professional; guards the cold hold.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"nPW9L6MCe5XhH8kibwAJT","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Ekene Adu","aliases":["Ekene"],"description":"Medic of the Patience, 52, Maren's lover. Gentle, stubborn, a pacifist who once worked as a contract medic at Tamsin's Rock after the Combine hushed it.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"vKXlNOjX8xtSpUZiQ81q8","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Bram Kovac","aliases":["Bram"],"description":"One of Hale's trusties, a hard young man with a shock-stick and no doubts.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Bonded"],"isAlive":true,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039},{"id":"zy_ZhsHXHC0jj-_7NOLkZ","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Mags Brask","aliases":["Mags"],"description":"Til's elder sister and Juno's mother, a salvager who died on the Harrow job eleven years before the story.","portraitImageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return"],"isAlive":false,"color":null,"createdAt":1793092365039,"updatedAt":1793092365039}],"items":[{"id":"6eDE2lwzwOlNYjCFhznnm","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Quist's key","description":"The factor's authorisation key, the only deliberate way to release the Sanitation Agent.","iconType":"key","imageId":null,"tags":["weapon"]},{"id":"AAktrO0RAt0RWKY8lfFZk","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"The Vey register","description":"Hollis Vey's family archive: Halloran-Vey loss registers and memoranda, five centuries old.","iconType":"book","imageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return"]},{"id":"IGvSUcZf7gSiGeh_vCJus","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"The Share Plate","description":"A steel plate cut from the Patience's hull, carrying the names of the three hundred bonded who took the ship. Later the founding relic of the city of Patience; its back hides an engraving under hull sealant.","iconType":"artifact","imageId":null,"tags":["cross-era","relic"]},{"id":"QwzXDb9ovzBXu8e0j8Zxm","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Maren's hook-knife","description":"A tether-chief's hook-bladed line knife, worn in a sheath on the coat. The tool of every cut in the book.","iconType":"weapon","imageId":null,"tags":["cross-era"]},{"id":"TasoOgVEjiiPK9YtVPwHn","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"The Hush","description":"Halloran-Vey Sanitation Agent, Pattern H, logged as Asset Seven: a matte ceramic egg in a cryo-sleeve that kills every human in a habitat and spares the machines. Fail-deadly: warmed past forty kelvin or breached, it vents. Cannot be destroyed, only kept cold.","iconType":"artifact","imageId":null,"tags":["weapon","cross-era"]},{"id":"VMt02IbaS9p35kOH-LROE","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Juno's bond","description":"The paper by which Mother Szabo owns Juno Brask's labour against her dead mother's debt.","iconType":"scroll","imageId":null,"tags":["The Last Return","debt"]},{"id":"d_XMAf_iUDIGtdIq6E57a","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Abel's recorder","description":"A rigger's voice-log, left on the Lamp with what Abel Tsolo had to say to whoever came.","iconType":"book","imageId":null,"tags":["cross-era"]},{"id":"hRN4THIXKrIE0OI-By48W","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Isaura's recorder","description":"The voice-log Isaura Venn leaves on the Lamp in 2654.","iconType":"book","imageId":null,"tags":["cross-era"]},{"id":"o9PghrlGx4PUPrE4eCEy6","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Lusine's clip","description":"The harness clip that failed on Lusine Arda's line, cut part-way through with a blade.","iconType":"other","imageId":null,"tags":["evidence"]},{"id":"sjIZbICiinWx5y2Rz7ye1","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Isaura's gauge","description":"An air-warden's flow gauge and valve key: the instrument of the air-tithe.","iconType":"other","imageId":null,"tags":["The Siege"]},{"id":"yqB6zymhctuNUq1SIqvH6","worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","name":"Tether-chief's coat","description":"Heavy quilted pressure-coat of the Patience's tether-chief, TSOLO stencilled across the back.","iconType":"armor","imageId":null,"tags":["cross-era"]}],"characterSnapshots":[{"worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","characterId":"gSFQNEhru5BVTCJEkx5If","eventId":"XTJ6kaxuImwVSUgHzT6NX","currentLocationMarkerId":"cA-LLlbz2_urmHZJMYCY3","currentMapLayerId":"-3FUCPr-YvwqnxSWDncm8","id":"-2P1BajEV3BDq6G60eu5F","sortKey":15.000001,"createdAt":1793110148132,"updatedAt":1793110148132,"version":1},{"worldId":"qazoRpRKLPklIu-1YyQ3E","characterId":"7uAqOYc-4fgdZRkVVqvyq","eventId":"XTJ6kaxuImwVSU